msgid "Generate Avatars"
msgstr ""

#: admin/configure.php:85
msgid ""
"When user has no avatar uploaded, generate avatar out of user name. If "
"disabled, default avatar picture is used for all users without profile "
"picture."
msgstr ""

#: admin/configure.php:89
msgid "Notify User only Once"
msgstr ""

#: admin/configure.php:92
msgid ""
"User will not be notified about new messages only if previous messages in "
"same conversation has been read."
msgstr ""

#: admin/configure.php:97
msgid "Deferred Email Notifications"
msgstr ""

#: admin/configure.php:101
msgid ""
"Queue notification emails and send them via cron_minutely. One email per "
"thread is sent after user stops messaging for configured delay. Requires "
"Osclass cron to be configured on hosting."
msgstr ""

